     TextChatService path when TextChannels exist. No more double-send risk.
  4. serverLockPanicSk / serverLockPanicPk were set but NEVER read in v3.0.
     They now drive a live panic loop (mon_lockpanic): if the ServerLock mode's
     backing setup (SK folder / PK light) is destroyed, it rebuilds it once and
     the pending-kick queue flushes automatically.
  5. Whitelist feature was dead state -- isWhitelisted() checked
     WhitelistedPlayers but nothing could ever add to it. Wired up:
     .whitelist / .unwhitelist / .whitelists commands + Antis-tab UI inputs.
     Whitelisted players are skipped by the gear blacklist monitor.
  6. startAntiKick leaked a CharacterAdded connection on every respawn and
     every re-toggle. The connection is now tracked and disconnected on stop.
  7. pauseLoops is now saved/restored (prevPause) inside crashPlayer and the
     SK/PK kick tasks, so overlapping kick + crash operations can no longer
     leave monitor loops permanently paused (or un-pause them too early).
  8. Rayfield loadstring is pcall-guarded. If the UI library fails to fetch,
     the script still loads: chat commands, keybinds, command bar and all
     antis keep working; notify() falls back to StarterGui SetCore.
  9. UI API detection is nil-tab safe (works with window == nil).
