-- (] prompt, live predictor, did-you-mean popup, .cmdlist browser).
-- Chat-send gate removed; anti-skick rewritten character-only.
-- 3.3.1: re-execution SELF-HEALS. The old guard silently returned when
-- _G.KAHX_VERSION was already set, which made re-running the script a
-- no-op -- the #1 "where is the command bar?" cause. Now a live v3.3+
-- instance is torn down through _G.KAHX_UNLOAD and a fresh one loads.
-- 3.3.2: command bar REDESIGNED per user request -- a small ] button
-- docked bottom-right; clicking it expands a textbox; the moment focus
-- leaves the box, the text inside executes and it collapses back.
-- Bar commands need NO prefix (only chat commands do). Plus .chatbind
-- (say a phrase in chat -> runs a command) and .keybind (command first,
-- key last) direct binding.
-- 3.3.3: THREE fixes. (1) FATAL UI bug: the custom UI attached custom
-- Lua fields to Roblox Instances ("row.nameLabel = ..."), Luau throws
-- "not a valid member of TextButton" and the whole bar/cmdlist build
-- died -- the real reason the UI "couldnt create namebutton" and never
-- showed. (2) Chat send order flipped: the legacy SayMessageRequest
-- remote is now PRIMARY (TextChatService channels silently no-op on
-- legacy-chat games). (3) SKICK PANIC: the anti-kick character check is
-- a while task.wait() loop; when it spots a SkateboardPlatform in YOUR
-- character it destroys it and stops EVERY loop except auto admin and
-- anti punish (stopAllLoopsExcept helper below).
-- 3.3.4: user round 4 -- chat channel arg corrected to "System" (user
-- verified), watchdog nil-global crash fixed (the "attempt to index nil
-- with 'Parent'" at the re-parent loop -- gui/parentHidden were locals
-- of the build closure but the watchdog ran OUTSIDE it), UI now parents
-- to PlayerGui FIRST (MkYuS gethui() contents exist but do not render),
-- pairs() traversal hardening for the "invalid key to 'next'" error,
-- F3X fallback now says "startergive", auto admin = loop-fire ONE RANDOM
-- pad until admin gained then SELF-STOPS (no more ":admin me" chat
-- spam by default), skick/pkick auto-setup kept + new success
-- confirmations (skick: platform in model AND y <= -505; pkick: tool
-- landed in target) with millisecond timing, and .dualkick (dk/dualk).
-- 3.3.5: user round 5 -- anti-skick now PAUSES loops TEMPORARILY for the
-- duration of handling the kick attempt (a watchdog resumes them -- they
-- are no longer killed forever). Target selectors "others" / "friends" /
-- "nonfriends" + COMMA multi-target ("skick noob,master") work on every
-- player command. UI rebuilt as ONE "KAHX_UI" folder inside the CoreGui
-- (gethui) holding the 2 ScreenGuis, with a loading screen (progress +
