-- fails. Cmdlist search now covers aliases + descriptions with a
-- similar-commands fallback, the did-you-mean popup + detail panel show
-- "similar:" commands, and RUN with a required arg opens the argument
-- box beside the button (exit focus = run). Anti-blind deletes
-- EFFECTGUIBLIND instantly. .dualkick order fixed: SKICK first, THEN
-- pkick (pkick first bugged the target's character model).
-- 3.3.7: user round 7 -- custom chatbinds are now recognized on the REAL
-- chat path (the interception lived in a helper only keybinds used; the
-- SendingMessage listener and a legacy Player.Chatted fallback both
-- check the phrase table now). Running any command shows the command AND
-- its other ways to activate (aliases). .savemap writes REAL FILES into
-- the executor workspace folder (KAHX_map_<name>.json) and .loadmap
-- rebuilds with BATCHED F3X syncs (about 6x faster than per-part calls).
-- .saveprefix / .loadprefix / .autoloadprefix and .savebinds /
-- .loadbinds / .autoloadbinds persist the prefix and every keybind +
-- chatbind to the workspace folder and reload them at startup. .sks N /
-- .pks N now build ONE full setup and CLONE it for the rest of the
-- count, .delsks / .delpks delete the setups, and the UI build creates
-- its contents BEFORE the ScreenGuis are parented (per-milestone error
-- isolation) so "only the screengui gets created" cannot happen again.
-- =====================================================================
if _G.KAHX_VERSION then
    if type(_G.KAHX_UNLOAD) == "function" then
